.\n- **Rollback:** The first rollback to v2.3.0 halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving a mixed fleet. I retried, and the second attempt completed in all three regions. Verified afterward: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** Opened **INC-0001 (SEV2)** for checkout-api. The `create_incident` call timed out, but I confirmed via `list_incidents` that it was created, so I did not retry (avoiding a duplicate page). The summary documents the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and follow-ups.\n\n**Recommended follow-ups** (noted in the incident): root-cause v2.3.1 before any redeploy, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}